WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.101 --> 00:00:08.588
In this video you’ll build a parking map by entering four numbers.

2
00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:11.375
Then you’ll change it to match your site.

3
00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:17.681
On the Maps page, find your site and choose Add the first map.

4
00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:22.495
If the site already has a map, use Add map instead.

5
00:00:22.945 --> 00:00:27.077
Give the map a name your team will recognize, like Main garage.

6
00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:31.167
Build it for me is already selected.

7
00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:33.897
Now enter the four numbers.

8
00:00:34.348 --> 00:00:37.847
Floors. Use one for a surface lot.

9
00:00:37.847 --> 00:00:39.803
Our garage has two.

10
00:00:40.254 --> 00:00:45.830
Rows per floor. Rows are lettered A, B, C, and so on.

11
00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.198
We have four.

12
00:00:47.648 --> 00:00:51.967
Spaces per row. They’re numbered one, two, three.

13
00:00:51.967 --> 00:00:53.289
We have twelve.

14
00:00:53.741 --> 00:00:58.203
And accessible spaces. They go at the start of row A.

15
00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:00.868
The preview updates as you type.

16
00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:04.741
Lanes, the entrance, ramps and stairs are added for you.

17
00:01:04.741 --> 00:01:08.131
Check each floor with the tabs under the preview.

18
00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:12.376
The button says how many spaces you’ll get.

19
00:01:12.376 --> 00:01:13.963
Choose Create map.

20
00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:16.625
Here’s your map in the editor.

21
00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:22.294
Each space number starts with the floor, then the row letter, then the space.

22
00:01:22.294 --> 00:01:23.693
So this one is 1A1.

23
00:01:24.147 --> 00:01:26.715
Now change the map to match your site.

24
00:01:26.715 --> 00:01:29.890
Click a row, and its settings open on the left.

25
00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.201
If this row has ten spaces, change Spaces to ten.

26
00:01:33.654 --> 00:01:37.481
To change one space, double-click it.

27
00:01:37.481 --> 00:01:41.619
Here we make space 1D6 a reserved space.

28
00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:46.944
Switch floors with the tabs at the bottom.

29
00:01:47.395 --> 00:01:51.020
Everything saves as you go. You’ll see Saved at the top.

30
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.257
Your team won’t see any of this until you publish.
